33490.a:
```hcl
terraform {
  encryption {
    key_provider "aws_kms" "main" {
      kms_key_id = "alias/tofu-state"
      region     = "eu-central-1"
      key_spec   = "AES_256"
    }
    method "aes_gcm" "main" { keys = key_provider.aws_kms.main }
    state { method = method.aes_gcm.main }
    plan  { method = method.aes_gcm.main }
  }
}
```

Afzallik: state backup yoki bucket oqib ketsa ham secret'lar o'qilmaydi; plan artefaktlari (CI'da saqlanadigan) ham himoyalangan.

Ehtiyot: kalit yo'qolsa state tiklanmaydi; kalit rotation uchun `fallback` bloki; Terraform'da (HashiCorp) bu imkoniyat yo'q — HCP Terraform'da server tomoni shifrlash.

33518.a:
```yaml
# GitHub Actions -> Azure (OIDC)
permissions: { id-token: write, contents: read }
steps:
  - uses: azure/login@v2
    with:
      client-id: ${{ vars.AZURE_CLIENT_ID }}
      tenant-id: ${{ vars.AZURE_TENANT_ID }}
      subscription-id: ${{ vars.AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID }}
  - run: az aks get-credentials -g rg-prod -n aks-prod && kubectl apply -f k8s/
```

Entra ID app registration'da federated credential: `repo:acme/api:environment:prod` — faqat shu repo va environment token ololadi. Azure DevOps'da: ARM service connection "Workload identity federation" turi.

33525.a:
```puppet
class nginx (String $worker_processes = 'auto') {
  package { 'nginx': ensure => installed }
  file { '/etc/nginx/nginx.conf':
    content => template('nginx/nginx.conf.erb'),
    require => Package['nginx'],
    notify  => Service['nginx'],
  }
  service { 'nginx': ensure => running, enable => true }
}
```
```yaml
# hiera: data/role/web.yaml
nginx::worker_processes: '8'
```

Oqim: agent → facts → Puppet Server catalog kompilyatsiya → agent qo'llaydi → report. Resurslar tartibi `require`/`notify` bilan aniq — e'lon tartibi emas.
